+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+### Particulars
+
+The `particulars` object contains event-specific details depending on `action`:
+
+- Assignment changes (`card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`): contains `assignee_ids`
+- Board changes (`card_board_changed`): contains `old_board` and `new_board`
+- Title changes (`card_title_changed`): contains `old_title` and `new_title`
+- Triage events (`card_triaged`): contains `column`
+
+Other events return an empty `particulars` object (`{}`). Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings (`""`).
